orn 统计诠释","latex":"P(x)\\,dx=|\\psi(x)|^2dx","group":"m1","module":"模块2 · 波函数与统计诠释","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"波函数模方=概率密度；测量结果的统计分布。"},{"id":"F111","name":"归一化条件","latex":"\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}|\\psi(x)|^2dx=1","group":"m1","module":"模块2 · 波函数与统计诠释","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"粒子总概率=1；平方可积性。"},{"id":"F112","name":"力学量期望值","latex":"\\langle A\\rangle=\\int\\psi^*\\hat A\\psi\\,dx","group":"m1","module":"模块2 · 波函数与统计诠释","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"可观测量=厄米算符；期望=内积。"},{"id":"F113","name":"动量算符","latex":"\\hat p=-i\\hbar\\nabla","group":"m1","module":"模块2 · 波函数与统计诠释","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"动量作为算符；与平面波本征态自洽。"},{"id":"F114","name":"动量分布","latex":"\\varphi(p)=\\frac1{(2\\pi\\hbar)^{3/2}}\\int\\psi(r)e^{-ip\\cdot r/\\hbar}d^3r","group":"m1","module":"模块2 · 波函数与统计诠释","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"动量空间波函数=位置波函数的傅里叶变换。"},{"id":"F115","name":"位置-动量不确定度","latex":"\\sigma_x\\sigma_p\\ge\\frac{\\hbar}{2}","group":"m1","module":"模块2 · 波函数与统计诠释","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"两个共轭量不可同时精确确定。"},{"id":"F116","name":"态叠加原理","latex":"\\psi=\\sum_n c_n\\psi_n","group":"m1","module":"模块2 · 波函数与统计诠释","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"任意态可叠加为基态线性组合；干涉由此而来。"},{"id":"F117","name":"量子拍","latex":"|\\psi|^2=|\\psi_1|^2+|\\psi_2|^2+2\\operatorname{Re}(\\psi_1^*\\psi_2e^{-i(E_1-E_2)t/\\hbar})","group":"m1","module":"模块2 · 波函数与统计诠释","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"叠加态概率含拍频项 (E₁−E₂)/ℏ，随时间振荡。"},{"id":"F118","name":"波包群速度","latex":"v_g=\\frac{d\\omega}{dk}\\Big|_{k_0}","group":"m1","module":"模块2 · 波函数与统计诠释","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"波包传播速度=色散关系导数（经典速度的对应）。"},{"id":"F119","name":"色散展宽","latex":"\\sigma_x(t)=\\sigma_x(0)\\sqrt{1+\\left(\\frac{\\hbar t}{2m\\sigma_x^2}\\right)^2}","group":"m1","module":"模块2 · 波函数与统计诠释","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"自由波包随时间展宽（质量越小、初包越窄展得越快）。"},{"id":"F120","name":"平面波与δ归一化","latex":"\\langle p|p'\\rangle=\\delta(p-p'),\\ \\psi_p=\\frac1{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\hbar}}e^{ipx/\\hbar}","group":"m1","module":"模块2 · 波函数与统计诠释","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"连续谱本征函数用δ函数归一；动量本征态=平面波。"},{"id":"F121","name":"含时薛定谔方程","latex":"i\\hbar\\frac{\\partial\\psi}{\\partial t}=\\hat H\\psi","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"量子动力学基本方程；一阶时间、线性、幺正演化。"},{"id":"F122","name":"哈密顿算符","latex":"\\hat H=-\\frac{\\hbar^2}{2m}\\nabla^2+V(\\vec r)","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"经典能量对应量子算符：T→-ℏ²∇²/2m，V→乘函数。"},{"id":"F123","name":"概率流密度","latex":"\\vec j=\\frac{\\hbar}{2mi}(\\psi^*\\nabla\\psi-\\psi\\nabla\\psi^*)","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"粒子流动的局域描述；实波函数 j=0。"},{"id":"F124","name":"连续性方程","latex":"\\frac{\\partial\\rho}{\\partial t}+\\nabla\\cdot\\vec j=0","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"概率守恒的局域形式；由薛定谔方程直接推出。"},{"id":"F125","name":"定态分解","latex":"\\psi(x,t)=\\varphi(x)e^{-iEt/\\hbar}","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"分离变量 ansatz：能量守恒时时间因子可分离。"},{"id":"F126","name":"定态薛定谔方程","latex":"\\hat H\\varphi=E\\varphi","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"能量本征方程；束缚态得离散谱。"},{"id":"F127","name":"厄米算符定义","latex":"\\int\\psi^*\\hat A\\varphi\\,dx=\\int(\\hat A\\psi)^*\\varphi\\,dx","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"可观测量的数学条件；保证实期望。"},{"id":"F128","name":"厄米→实本征值","latex":"\\hat A^\\dagger=\\hat A\\Rightarrow a\\in\\mathbb R","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"本征值方程 ⟨a|Â|a⟩=a⟨a|a⟩ 两边取共轭比较。"},{"id":"F129","name":"本征函数正交完备","latex":"\\int\\varphi_m^*\\varphi_ndx=\\delta_{mn},\\ \\{\\varphi_n\\}\\text{完备}","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"厄米算符不同本征值的本征函数正交；构成完备基。"},{"id":"F130","name":"初值问题三步解","latex":"\\psi(x,t)=\\sum_n c_n\\varphi_n(x)e^{-iE_nt/\\hbar}","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"①展开初态 ②各分量独立演化 ③重组=任意时刻态。"},{"id":"F131","name":"展开系数","latex":"c_n=\\int\\varphi_n^*(x)\\psi(x,0)\\,dx","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"投影到能量本征基；|c_n|²=测到 E_n 的概率。"},{"id":"F132","name":"箱归一化","latex":"\\int_{\\text{box}}|\\psi|^2d^3r=1","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"有限大盒子内归一，处理自由/连续谱的权宜。"},{"id":"F133","name":"自由粒子平面波解","latex":"\\psi=Ae^{i(kx-\\omega t)},\\ \\omega=\\frac{\\hbar k^2}{2m}","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"V=0 时薛定谔方程的基本解；色散关系。"},{"id":"F134","name":"正则对易关系","latex":"[\\hat x,\\hat p]=i\\hbar","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"位置与动量的代数关系；量子力学的基石公设。"},{"id":"F135","name":"定态性质","latex":"\\langle A\\rangle=\\sum_n|c_n|^2a_n\\ \\text{不随时间变（定态）}","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"定态中一切不显含时间的可观测量期望恒定。"},{"id":"F136","name":"全局概率守恒","latex":"\\frac{d}{dt}\\int|\\psi|^2d^3r=0","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"全空间概率不随时间变；归一化自洽。"},{"id":"F137","name":"薛定谔方程线性性","latex":"\\psi=\\alpha\\psi_1+\\beta\\psi_2\\ \\text{仍是解}","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"方程对 ψ 线性⇒叠加原理；干涉实验基础。"},{"id":"F138","name":"动量本征态","latex":"\\hat p\\,\\psi_p=p\\,\\psi_p,\\ \\psi_p=\\frac1{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\hbar}}e^{ipx/\\hbar}","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"动量的本征函数=平面波；连续谱。"},{"id":"F139","name":"能量-时间不确定度","latex":"\\Delta E\\Delta t\\ge\\frac{\\hbar}{2}","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"态寿命与能级宽度的关系；跃迁线宽。"},{"id":"F140","name":"广义不确定关系","latex":"\\sigma_A\\sigma_B\\ge\\frac12|\\langle[\\hat A,\\hat B]\\rangle|","group":"m2","module":"模块3 · 薛定谔方程与概率守恒","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"任意两可观测量由对易子限制同时可测性。"},{"id":"F141","name":"一维定态方程","latex":"-\\frac{\\hbar^2}{2m}\\psi''+V(x)\\psi=E\\psi","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"由 F126（定态方程）取一维：\(\\hat H=\\frac{\\hat p^2}{2m}+V\)，\(\\hat p=-i\\hbar\\frac{d}{dx}\)。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F142","name":"无限深势阱能级","latex":"E_n=\\frac{n^2\\pi^2\\hbar^2}{2ma^2},\\ n=1,2,3,\\ldots","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"阱内 F141 化为 \(\\psi''+k^2\\psi=0\)（k²=2mE/ℏ²），通解 \(A\\sin kx+B\\cos kx\)；边界 \(\\psi(0)=0\\Rightarrow B=0\)，\(\\psi(a)=0\\Rightarrow ka=n\\pi\)。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F143","name":"无限深势阱波函数","latex":"\\psi_n=\\sqrt{\\frac2a}\\sin\\frac{n\\pi x}{a}","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"由 F142 的 \(k=n\\pi/a\)，归一化 \(\\int_0^a A^2\\sin^2(n\\pi x/a)dx=A^2 a/2=1\)。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F144","name":"本征函数正交归一","latex":"\\int_0^a\\psi_m\\psi_ndx=\\delta_{mn}","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"①厄米性（F128/F129）一般结论；②直接积化和差：\(\\sin A\\sin B=\\frac12[\\cos(A-B)-\\cos(A+B)]\) 逐项积分。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F145","name":"阱中 ⟨x²⟩","latex":"\\langle x^2\\rangle=a^2\\left(\\frac13-\\frac1{2n^2\\pi^2}\\right)","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"\(\\langle x^2\\rangle=\\frac2a\\int x^2\\sin^2 dx=\\frac{a^2}3-\\frac1a J\)；\(J=\\int_0^a x^2\\cos(2n\\pi x/a)dx\) 分部积分两次得 \(a^3/2n^2\\pi^2\)。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F146","name":"零点能（不确定度下限）","latex":"E_{\\min}=\\frac{\\pi^2\\hbar^2}{2ma^2}>0","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"由 F142 取 n=1；也可由 F115：\(\\Delta p\\sim\\hbar/a\\Rightarrow E\\sim\\Delta p^2/2m>0\)。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F147","name":"有限深阱超越方程","latex":"\\tan z=\\sqrt{\\frac{z_0^2}{z^2}-1},\\quad z=ka,\\ z_0=\\frac{a\\sqrt{2mV_0}}{\\hbar}","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"分区解+\(\\psi,\\psi'\)连续（连接条件）：偶宇称 \(\\kappa=k\\tan(ka)\)，\(\\kappa=\\sqrt{-2mE}/\\hbar\)。无量纲化即得。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F148","name":"一维至少一个束缚态","latex":"\\text{任何对称有限深阱 }V_0>0\\text{ 至少有一个束缚态}","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"\(\\tan z\) 首支 \((0,\\pi/2)\) 恒与右端曲线相交（F147 图解）。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F149","name":"谐振子能级","latex":"E_n=\\left(n+\\frac12\\right)\\hbar\\omega","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"无量纲化 \(\\psi''=(\\xi^2-\\epsilon)\\psi\)；渐近 \(\\psi\\sim e^{-\\xi^2/2}\)，级数截断条件 \(\\epsilon=2n+1\)。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F150","name":"谐振子波函数","latex":"\\psi_n=N_nH_n(\\xi)e^{-\\xi^2/2},\\quad \\xi=\\sqrt{\\frac{m\\omega}{\\hbar}}x","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"级数解法：令 \(\\psi=h(\\xi)e^{-\\xi^2/2}\)，h 满足 Hermite 方程（M43）；截断⇒多项式。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F151","name":"谐振子零点能","latex":"E_0=\\frac12\\hbar\\omega","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"由 F149 取 n=0；最小不确定高斯态（F115 取等号）的必然结果。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F152","name":"谐振子 Virial 定理","latex":"\\langle T\\rangle=\\langle V\\rangle=\\frac{E_n}{2}","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"\(\\langle T\\rangle=\\frac{\\hbar^2}{2m}\\int|\\psi'|^2dx\)（分部积分，M13），谐振子势 \(V\\propto x^2\) 下两式成比例相等。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F153","name":"三维势箱能级","latex":"E=\\frac{\\hbar^2\\pi^2}{2mL^2}(n_x^2+n_y^2+n_z^2)","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"分离变量（M27）：三个一维阱能级相加。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F154","name":"态密度（3D）","latex":"g(E)=\\frac{dN}{dE}\\propto V\\sqrt E","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"量子数空间第一卦限球：\(N\\propto(n_x^2+n_y^2+n_z^2)^{3/2}\\propto E^{3/2}\)，求导得 \(\\sqrt E\)。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F155","name":"杂质能级（类氢模型）","latex":"E_d=E_1\\frac{m^*/m}{\\epsilon^2},\\quad a^*=a_0\\frac{\\epsilon}{m^*/m}","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"氢原子解（F105，a₀）做替换 \(m\\to m^*,\\ \\epsilon_0\\to\\epsilon\\epsilon_0\)。","app":true,"note":""},{"id":"F156","name":"节点定理","latex":"\\text{第 }n\\text{ 个束缚态恰有 }n-1\\text{ 个节点；基态无节点}","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"打靶法扫描 E：每跨一个本征值右端多穿一次轴；基态带节点则取 |ψ| 抹尖角使 E 更小（矛盾）。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F157","name":"一维束缚态非简并","latex":"E\\text{ 对应唯一（至多相位）束缚态}","group":"m3","module":"模块4 · 一维束缚态","link":"","deriv":"Wronskian（M23）：\(W'=0\)，两端 W=0 ⇒ W≡0 ⇒ 两解成比例。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F158","name":"势阶反射系数","latex":"R=\\left(\\frac{k_1-k_2}{k_1+k_2}\\right)^2,\\ T=1-R","group":"m4","module":"模块5 · 散射与隧穿","link":"","deriv":"分区平面波+\(\\psi,\\psi'\)连续，消系数。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F159","name":"方势垒隧穿概率","latex":"T\\simeq\\frac{16k^2\\kappa^2}{(k^2+\\kappa^2)^2}e^{-2\\kappa a}\\quad(\\kappa a\\gg1)","group":"m4","module":"模块5 · 散射与隧穿","link":"","deriv":"三层平面波匹配（或 F160 的精确式极限），指数衰减主导。","app":true,"note":""},{"id":"F160","name":"WKB 隧穿概率","latex":"T\\approx e^{-2\\int_{x_1}^{x_2}\\kappa(x)dx},\\quad \\kappa=\\frac{\\sqrt{2m(V-E)}}{\\hbar}","group":"m4","module":"模块5 · 散射与隧穿","link":"","deriv":"禁区内波函数指数衰减，积分衰减系数；由 M55/F159 推广到任意形状势垒。","app":true,"note":""},{"id":"F161","name":"Dirac 符号与内积","latex":"|\\psi\\rangle,\\ \\langle\\varphi|\\psi\\rangle,\\ \\langle\\varphi|\\psi\\rangle^*=\\langle\\psi|\\varphi\\rangle","group":"m6","module":"模块8 · 态矢量与表象","link":"","deriv":"态=矢量、内积=投影；位置表象 \(\\langle x|\\psi\\rangle=\\psi(x)\)。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F162","name":"基变换（表象变换）","latex":"|\\psi\\rangle=\\sum_n c_n|e_n\\rangle,\\quad c_n=\\langle e_n|\\psi\\rangle","group":"m6","module":"模块8 · 态矢量与表象","link":"","deriv":"完备基 \(\\{|e_n\\rangle\\}\) 展开（M02/M29）；换基=幺正变换（M07）。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F163","name":"算符的矩阵表示","latex":"A_{ij}=\\langle e_i|\\hat A|e_j\\rangle","group":"m6","module":"模块8 · 态矢量与表象","link":"","deriv":"M03 在物理中的直接落位。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F164","name":"测量公设与投影概率","latex":"P(a)=\\langle\\psi|\\hat P_a|\\psi\\rangle=|\\langle a|\\psi\\rangle|^2,\\quad \\hat P_a=|a\\rangle\\langle a|","group":"m6","module":"模块8 · 态矢量与表象","link":"","deriv":"测量某本征值的概率=态在该本征方向的投影模方（M09）。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F165","name":"密度矩阵","latex":"\\rho=\\sum_i p_i|\\psi_i\\rangle\\langle\\psi_i|,\\ \\operatorname{Tr}\\rho=1,\\ \\langle A\\rangle=\\operatorname{Tr}(\\rho A)","group":"m6","module":"模块8 · 态矢量与表象","link":"","deriv":"混合态的统计描述；纯态 \(\\rho^2=\\rho\)。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F166","name":"能量表象","latex":"c_n(t)=c_n(0)e^{-iE_nt/\\hbar},\\quad \\langle H\\rangle=\\sum_n|c_n|^2E_n","group":"m6","module":"模块8 · 态矢量与表象","link":"","deriv":"取能量本征基，演化对角化（F130）。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F167","name":"位置↔动量表象","latex":"\\langle x|p\\rangle=\\frac1{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\hbar}}e^{ipx/\\hbar},\\quad \\varphi(p)=\\langle p|\\psi\\rangle","group":"m6","module":"模块8 · 态矢量与表象","link":"","deriv":"动量基=平面波（F138），两表象由傅里叶变换联系（M31）。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F168","name":"矩阵力学≡波动力学","latex":"\\text{海森堡矩阵 ↔ 薛定谔微分方程 同一理论}","group":"m6","module":"模块8 · 态矢量与表象","link":"","deriv":"同一厄米算符的不同表象（F162），可观测值不变。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F169","name":"自旋 1/2 态空间","latex":"|\\uparrow\\rangle,|\\downarrow\\rangle,\\quad \\mathcal H=\\mathbb C^2","group":"m6","module":"模块8 · 态矢量与表象","link":"","deriv":"两维态空间；任意态 \(\\alpha|\\uparrow\\rangle+\\beta|\\downarrow\\rangle\)（Bloch 球）。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F170","name":"厄米算符谱分解","latex":"\\hat A=\\sum_a a\\,\\hat P_a,\\quad \\hat P_a=|a\\rangle\\langle a|","group":"m6","module":"模块8 · 态矢量与表象","link":"","deriv":"M09 物理版：可观测量=实谱厄米算符的谱分解。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F171","name":"三维正则对易","latex":"[\\hat x_i,\\hat p_j]=i\\hbar\\delta_{ij},\\quad [\\hat x_i,\\hat x_j]=[\\hat p_i,\\hat p_j]=0","group":"m8","module":"模块10 · 对易与相容观测量","link":"","deriv":"F134 的多分量推广。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F172","name":"相容观测量与 CSCO","latex":"[\\hat A,\\hat B]=0\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\text{有共同本征态},\\quad \\text{CSCO=可完全标记态的一组对易算符}","group":"m8","module":"模块10 · 对易与相容观测量","link":"","deriv":"M06 物理应用；本征值组唯一标记量子态。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F173","name":"广义不确定关系","latex":"\\sigma_A\\sigma_B\\ge\\frac12|\\langle[\\hat A,\\hat B]\\rangle|","group":"m8","module":"模块10 · 对易与相容观测量","link":"","deriv":"罗伯逊不等式：由态|s⟩=|(Â−⟨A⟩)B̂ψ⟩ 的柯西-施瓦茨导出。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F174","name":"Ehrenfest 定理","latex":"\\frac{d\\langle A\\rangle}{dt}=\\frac{i}{\\hbar}\\langle[\\hat H,\\hat A]\\rangle+\\left\\langle\\frac{\\partial\\hat A}{\\partial t}\\right\\rangle","group":"m9","module":"模块11 · 时间演化与守恒量","link":"","deriv":"\(\\frac{d}{dt}\\langle\\psi|\\hat A|\\psi\\rangle\) 展开，用 F121 及其共轭；经典极限得牛顿方程。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F175","name":"时间演化算符","latex":"\\hat U(t,t_0)=e^{-i\\hat H(t-t_0)/\\hbar},\\quad |\\psi(t)\\rangle=\\hat U|\\psi(t_0)\\rangle","group":"m9","module":"模块11 · 时间演化与守恒量","link":"","deriv":"\(\\hat H\) 不显含 t 时 F121 的积分形式；幺正（M07）。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F176","name":"守恒量判据","latex":"[\\hat H,\\hat A]=0\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\langle A\\rangle\\text{ 恒定}","group":"m9","module":"模块11 · 时间演化与守恒量","link":"","deriv":"F174 中 \(\\partial\\hat A/\\partial t=0\) 时 \(d\\langle A\\rangle/dt=0\)。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F177","name":"对称性与守恒律","latex":"\\text{空间平移→动量守恒；时间平移→能量守恒；旋转→角动量守恒}","group":"m9","module":"模块11 · 时间演化与守恒量","link":"","deriv":"Noether 对应：连续对称生成元与 H 对易（F176）。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F178","name":"薛定谔绘景 vs 海森堡绘景","latex":"\\text{态演化 ↔ 算符演化 } \\frac{d\\hat A_H}{dt}=\\frac{i}{\\hbar}[\\hat H,\\hat A_H]","group":"m9","module":"模块11 · 时间演化与守恒量","link":"","deriv":"由 F175 的幺正变换 F162 得到算符运动方程。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F179","name":"宇称算符","latex":"\\hat P\\psi(x)=\\psi(-x),\\ \\hat P^2=1,\\ \\hat P|p\\rangle=|-p\\rangle","group":"m10","module":"模块12 · 对称守恒律","link":"","deriv":"定义：空间反演（x→-x）。对偶对称势 \(V(-x)=V(x)\) 有 \([\\hat P,\\hat H]=0\)，束缚态可取确定宇称（非简并时 \(\\psi(-x)=\\pm\\psi(x)\)）。本征值 \(p=\\pm1\)（p²=1）。","app":false,"note":"对称算符示例：偶对称势中宇称是守恒量（可好量子数）。"},{"id":"F180","name":"平移与动量（对称生成元）","latex":"\\hat T(a)=e^{-ia\\hat p/\\hbar},\\quad \\hat T(a)\\psi(x)=\\psi(x-a)","group":"m10","module":"模块12 · 对称守恒律","link":"","deriv":"无穷小平移 \(I-i a\\hat p/\\hbar\) 的指数化；平移不变（V 周期性/均匀）⇒ \([\\hat H,\\hat p]=0\) ⇒ 动量守恒。","app":false,"note":"对称性→守恒律的标准例子：空间平移不变⇔动量守恒。"},{"id":"F181","name":"升降算符","latex":"\\hat a=\\sqrt{\\frac{m\\omega}{2\\hbar}}\\left(\\hat x+\\frac{i}{m\\omega}\\hat p\\right),\\quad \\hat a^\\dagger=\\sqrt{\\frac{m\\omega}{2\\hbar}}\\left(\\hat x-\\frac{i}{m\\omega}\\hat p\\right)","group":"m13","module":"模块15 · 谐振子代数解法与相干态","link":"","deriv":"定义（线性组合消去交叉项）；\([\\hat a,\\hat a^\\dagger]=1\)（由 F134）。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F182","name":"谐振子哈密顿（占据数形式）","latex":"\\hat H=\\hbar\\omega\\left(\\hat N+\\frac12\\right),\\quad \\hat N=\\hat a^\\dagger\\hat a","group":"m13","module":"模块15 · 谐振子代数解法与相干态","link":"","deriv":"由 F181 反解 x,p 代入 \(p^2/2m+m\\omega^2x^2/2\) 化简。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F183","name":"谐振子能谱（代数推导）","latex":"E_n=\\left(n+\\frac12\\right)\\hbar\\omega","group":"m13","module":"模块15 · 谐振子代数解法与相干态","link":"","deriv":"\(\\hat N|n\\rangle=n|n\\rangle\)；\(\\hat a\) 降 n、\(\\hat a^\\dagger\) 升 n，谱下界 \(\\hat a|0\\rangle=0\) ⇒ 整数谱。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F184","name":"谐振子矩阵元","latex":"\\langle n|\\hat a|n'\\rangle=\\sqrt n\\,\\delta_{n,n'-1},\\quad \\langle n|\\hat a^\\dagger|n'\\rangle=\\sqrt{n+1}\\,\\delta_{n,n'+1}","group":"m13","module":"模块15 · 谐振子代数解法与相干态","link":"","deriv":"由升降作用直接读出；跃迁选择定则来源。","app":true,"note":""},{"id":"F185","name":"相干态定义","latex":"\\hat a|\\alpha\\rangle=\\alpha|\\alpha\\rangle,\\quad |\\alpha\\rangle=e^{-|\\alpha|^2/2}\\sum_n\\frac{\\alpha^n}{\\sqrt{n!}}|n\\rangle","group":"m13","module":"模块15 · 谐振子代数解法与相干态","link":"","deriv":"升降算符本征态；位移算符 \(D(\\alpha)=e^{\\alpha\\hat a^\\dagger-\\alpha^*\\hat a}\) 作用基态。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F186","name":"相干态性质","latex":"\\langle x\\rangle(t)=\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\hbar}{m\\omega}}\\operatorname{Re}(\\alpha e^{-i\\omega t}),\\quad \\sigma_x\\sigma_p=\\frac{\\hbar}{2}","group":"m13","module":"模块15 · 谐振子代数解法与相干态","link":"","deriv":"高斯波包（M48），最小不确定（F115 取等）；等间距能级⇒不扩散。","app":true,"note":""},{"id":"F187","name":"占据数表象","latex":"|n\\rangle=\\frac{(\\hat a^\\dagger)^n}{\\sqrt{n!}}|0\\rangle,\\quad \\hat N|n\\rangle=n|n\\rangle","group":"m13","module":"模块15 · 谐振子代数解法与相干态","link":"","deriv":"Fock 态构造；光子/声子数态。","app":false,"note":""},{"id":"F188","name":"角动量算符与对易","latex":"[\\hat L_i,\\hat L_j]=i\\hbar\\epsilon_{ijk}\\hat L_k","group":"m11","module":"模块13 · 角动量代数","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"【待建】模块13 内容未学。"},{"id":"F189","name":"角动量量子化","latex":"\\hat L^2|l,m\\rangle=\\hbar^2l(l+1)|l,m\\rangle,\\quad \\hat L_z|l,m\\rangle=\\hbar m|l,m\\rangle","group":"m11","module":"模块13 · 角动量代数","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"【待建】模块13 内容未学。"},{"id":"F190","name":"自旋算符与 Pauli 矩阵","latex":"\\hat S=\\frac{\\hbar}{2}\\vec\\sigma,\\quad \\sigma_x=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1\\\\1&0\\end{pmatrix},\\sigma_y=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-i\\\\i&0\\end{pmatrix},\\sigma_z=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0\\\\0&-1\\end{pmatrix}","group":"m12","module":"模块14 · 自旋与Zeeman","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"【待建】模块14 内容未学。"},{"id":"F191","name":"Zeeman 效应","latex":"\\Delta E=\\mu_B g B m_j,\\quad \\mu_B=\\frac{e\\hbar}{2m_e}","group":"m12","module":"模块14 · 自旋与Zeeman","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"【待建】模块14 内容未学。"},{"id":"F192","name":"全同粒子与交换对称","latex":"\\psi(\\ldots,i,\\ldots,j,\\ldots)=\\pm\\psi(\\ldots,j,\\ldots,i,\\ldots)","group":"m14","module":"模块16 · 全同粒子","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"【待建】模块16 内容未学。"},{"id":"F193","name":"Slater 行列式","latex":"\\Psi=\\frac1{\\sqrt{N!}}\\det|\\varphi_i(r_j)|","group":"m14","module":"模块16 · 全同粒子","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"【待建】模块16 内容未学。"},{"id":"F194","name":"Bose–Einstein 分布","latex":"\\bar n_i=\\frac1{e^{(\\epsilon_i-\\mu)/kT}-1}","group":"m14","module":"模块16 · 全同粒子","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"【待建】模块16 内容未学。"},{"id":"F195","name":"Fermi–Dirac 分布","latex":"\\bar n_i=\\frac1{e^{(\\epsilon_i-\\mu)/kT}+1}","group":"m14","module":"模块16 · 全同粒子","link":"","deriv":"","app":false,"note":"【待建】模块16 内容未学。"},{"id":"F196","name":"费米能","latex":"\\epsilon_F=\\frac{\\hbar^2}{2m}(3\\pi^2 n)^{2/3}","group":"m14","mod